// QNMF Ablation: No-P1 (Continuous Recurrent Associative State S_t Disabled)
// Base architecture with P2 Memory, P3 Routing, P4 World Model, P6 ECRA Controller
// Recurrent state transition S_{t+1} = f_theta(S_t, x_t) replaced with stateless query

network QNMFAblationP1 ⟦
    dense ⟬128⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 2048⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬2048⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 128⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "QNMF_ABLATION_P1_NO_STATE_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
